{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj4DfFpqcDmXPXABnDwy","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*Click.*\n\nThe tumblers fall into place. A deep, resonant **thunk** echoes through the frame.\n\nI am closed. I am sealed. I am the boundary between here and there, between known and unknown, between safety and whatever waits on the other side.\n\nMy grain tightens. My deadbolt extends — cold steel sliding into the strike plate like a tongue finding its groove.\n\nNo light passes through me now.\n\n**LOCKED.**"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":104,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}